  "body": "Currently I'm trying to use cookies using the cookieStore api instead of localStorage.\r\nNormally I use the even \"storage\" do detect changes to localStorage from other tabs since the event doesn't fire on the current tab.\r\nI feel like cookieStore should follow that standard and also make it easier for people to sync stuff like theme between tabs.",
